== Toric

Let $N tilde.equiv ZZ^r$ be a lattice, and $M := op("Hom") (N,ZZ)$

coordinate ring of toric variety $X$ is a  ring graded in $op("Cl")(X)$

$ op("Cox")(X) := k[{v:v in Delta (1)}] $

where $deg v_i = [v_i] in op("Cl")(X)$

And $G= (k^*)^(Delta(1)) : = op("Hom")(ZZ^(Delta(1)),k^*)$ acts on $op("Cox")(X)$

